.TH DEEPWORK 1 "" "DeepWork" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
deepwork \- block distracting websites and apps
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B deepwork
[\fB\-\-background\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The DeepWork app: create blocks of websites and apps, start them or give them a schedule, and
lock them. Blocks are enforced by the \fBdeepwork-daemon\fR service, so closing the app doesn't
end them.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-background
Start without a window, with only the top-bar indicator and notifications (used at login).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR deepworkctl (1),
.BR deepwork-daemon (8)
.PP
https://github.com/ichbinstudent/deepwork
